From 3babff305c51109c99d250033e3ce632edce7127 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mauvis Ledford <20738+krunkosaurus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:58:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] server: preserve controls in long-form speech chunks

Keep complete special tokens, bracketed cues and nested paired tags intact across sentence, clause, space and code-point splitting. Protect topic-shift preprocessing and recognize CJK boundaries without changing prompt or frame ceilings.

Exercise exact whole and streamed prompt segments, oversized spans, malformed controls and redraws. Drain inherited socket fixtures before joining so CPU validation completes on macOS.

Refs: https://github.com/plotarmordev/drama-tensorfold/issues/25
